params.body:
The questions on /services were a narrow list on the left of a 1440 px page, ending halfway across the screen. /pricing already set them out differently.

Both pages now use `x-faq`:
- the heading on the left;
- the questions on the right, running to the page's right edge, so they align with the rest of the page;
- each question a stone block with no rules;
- the answer in the body colour, a dark plus and a green focus ring.

This is one component, so the two pages cannot drift apart again.

All tests pass. Checked locally at 1440 px.
